<title>USA: Biomerica Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Biomerica Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended November 30</p>
<p>						 1995		 1996</p>
<p> Net Revenues			$2,273,288	  $2,279,638</p>
<p> Income (loss)			   95,188	     103,681</p>
<p> Income (loss) per share		 0.03		  0.03</p>
<p> Shares Outstanding		 3,441,819	   3,538,602</p>
<p>For the Six Months Ended November 30</p>
<p>						1995		  1996</p>
<p> Net Revenues			 4,602,576	   4,553,025</p>
<p> Income (loss)			  155,493	     230,885</p>
<p> Income (loss) per share		 0.05		  0.07</p>
<p> Shares Outstanding		 3,441,007	   3,526,469</p>
<p>BIOMERICA (Nasdaq: BMRA) is an emerging international biomedical company engaged in the development, manufacturing and marketing of advanced medical diagnostic products to physicians offices, reference laboratories and consumers for home self testing.</p>
</text>
